        <div class="h1_gov">SaskPower</div>

        <div id='saskpower_stats' class='gov_stats'>
            <div>Electrification: [+ electrification +]%</div>
            <div class="market_share_wrapper"> Market Share: [+ electricity_pie_chart +]</div>
            <div class='tab_container'>
                <div id='saskpower_options' style="justify-content: center;" class='tab_button' onclick="window.dendryUI.dendryEngine.goToScene('economy');">Saskpower Actions</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>


    <div id="sasktel_panel" class="gov_panel">
        <div class="h1_gov">SaskTel</div>

        <div id='saskpower_tel' class='gov_stats'>
            <div>Telecoms Access: [+ telecoms +]%</div>
            <div class="market_share_wrapper"> Market Share: [+ telecoms_pie_chart +]</div>
            <div class='tab_container'>
                <div id='sasktel_options' style="justify-content: center;" class='tab_button' onclick="window.ChangeTab('crown_corps', 'government_options.sasktel_choices', 'sasktel_options');">SaskTel Actions</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>


<div id="crown_corps_actions" style="padding: 2em;">
</div>

@saskpower_choices
new-page: true
is-card: true
card-image: img/CCYM_Sings.jpg

= SaskPower

SaskPower is the Crown Corporation dealing with power generation and distribution. Formed as the Saskatchewan Power Comission, it has made significant inroads into the private market, purchasing independently-owned electrical utilities. 

- @saskpower_monopoly: Grant SaskPower a Monopoly on Power
- @power_buyout: Buy Out Electrical Utilities Companies
- @power_sellout: Sell Parts of SaskPower to Private Companies
- @electrical_coop_sellout: Use SaskPower assets to establish Electrical Sector Worker's Cooperatives
- @rural_electrification: Expand Access to Electricity


@saskpower_monopoly
subtitle: -5 budget, 100% Market Share
view-if: 1 = 1
choose-if: budget >= 20

@power_buyout
subtitle: -1 budget, +10% Market Share
choose-if: budget >= 1 

@power_sellout
subtitle: +1 budget, -10% Market Share
on-arrival: budget += 1

@electrical_coop_sellout
subtitle: -10% Market Share, +1 budget


@rural_electrification
subtitle: -1 budget
choose-if: budget >= 1


@ministries_options 

